// Raahi architecture — paste into eraser.io → New diagram → Cloud Architecture (diagram as code)
title Raahi: offline-first learning to livelihood
direction right
colorMode pastel
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

Users [color: gray] {
  Student [icon: user]
  Teacher [icon: users]
  NGO or Govt admin [icon: briefcase]
}

Android app offline first [icon: android, color: blue] {
  Compose UI and Didi [icon: smartphone]
  Voice [icon: mic, label: "Vosk STT · Android TTS"]
  Repository [icon: layers, label: "Repository (single source of truth)"]
  Local engines [icon: cpu, label: "Rules engine · Career scorer · Answer search"]
  Encrypted DB [icon: database, label: "Room + SQLCipher"]
  Sync outbox [icon: refresh-cw, label: "WorkManager outbox"]
  Mesh share [icon: bluetooth, label: "Nearby Connections"]
}

Other phones [icon: smartphone, color: blue]

Edge [color: orange] {
  API gateway [icon: shield, label: "API gateway · OAuth2 · TLS"]
  CDN packs [icon: package, label: "CDN · signed content packs"]
  Dashboard [icon: monitor, label: "Next.js dashboard"]
}

Cloud on Kubernetes [icon: k8s-engine, color: green] {
  Core service [icon: java, label: "Spring Boot core"]
  AI service [icon: python, label: "FastAPI · RAG · safety filter"]
  Keycloak [icon: key]
  Postgres [icon: postgresql, label: "PostgreSQL + pgvector"]
  Redis [icon: redis, label: "Redis answer cache"]
  Kafka [icon: kafka, label: "Redpanda / Kafka events"]
  Object storage [icon: hard-drive, label: "MinIO / S3 packs"]
  Ingestion [icon: download-cloud, label: "Ingestion jobs + human review"]
}

External [color: purple] {
  Public data [icon: globe, label: "myScheme · NSP · NAPS · NCS · DIKSHA · SWAYAM · Skill India · AISHE · NCO · PLFS"]
  Bhashini [icon: message-circle, label: "Bhashini speech + translation"]
  Open LLM [icon: zap, label: "Open-weight LLM (Llama / Gemma)"]
  Partners [icon: link, label: "Colleges · Employers · NGOs · Govt"]
}

// on the phone, no network needed
Student > Compose UI and Didi
Teacher > Compose UI and Didi
Compose UI and Didi <> Voice
Compose UI and Didi > Repository
Repository > Local engines
Local engines > Encrypted DB
Repository > Encrypted DB
Encrypted DB > Sync outbox
Mesh share <> Other phones: signed packs only

// when network is available
Sync outbox > API gateway: delta sync
CDN packs > Encrypted DB: verified packs
NGO or Govt admin > Dashboard
Dashboard > API gateway
API gateway > Core service
API gateway > AI service
API gateway > Keycloak: tokens
Core service > Postgres
Core service > Kafka
Core service > Object storage
Object storage > CDN packs
AI service > Postgres: vector search
AI service > Redis
AI service > Open LLM: grounded prompt
AI service > Bhashini
Public data > Ingestion
Ingestion > Postgres
Partners <> API gateway: OpenAPI + webhooks
